OL,3,GNEWSAGas bill standing charges to be
OL,4,Ascrapped, chancellor says ahead of
OL,5,ABudget
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government has promised a plan that
OL,8,F"moves money and power out of
OL,9,FWestminster", but ministers face
OL,10,Fpressure on the cost of living and
OL,11,Fgovernment borrowing
OL,13,FAhead of this first Budget of Andy
OL,14,FBurnham's premiership, our political
OL,15,Fcorrespondent says opposition parties
OL,16,Fhave criticised what they see as
OL,17,Flimited scale and ambition
